      <title>Do animals have a future on Hollywood sets?</title>
      <link>https://www.downtoearth.org.in/science-technology/do-animals-have-a-future-on-hollywood-sets</link>
      <description>Hollywood is increasingly replacing live animal actors with CGI and motion capture, driven by activism and technological advances. This shift raises questions about animal welfare and creative freedom, as digital animals allow for more graphic depictions of violence.</description>
